This covers the Maudette character, her sprites and Aseprite files, and data
generated from them.

In this repository: the files in mascots/maudette/, and data generated from
them (maudette.mascot.json, and mod/hooks/sprites.ts when she is bundled).
The code that draws and animates her is MIT licensed: see LICENSE at the root.
